---
import { whatsappHref } from "@/data/contact";
---

<section class="section-hk bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,#1b4f72,#2e86c1)] text-white">
  <div class="container-hk grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="font-heading text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/74">Cotizacion</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-heading text-3xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-5xl">
        Conversemos sobre el punto debil antes de comprar tecnologia.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-white/78">
        Un buen proyecto empieza con una evaluacion honesta de riesgo, presupuesto y prioridad.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row md:flex-col">
      <a
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white px-5 py-3 font-heading text-sm font-semibold text-hk-primary transition duration-200 hover:bg-hk-surface focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
        href={whatsappHref}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        Hablar por WhatsApp
      </a>
      <a
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/70 px-5 py-3 font-heading text-sm font-semibold text-white transition duration-200 hover:bg-white hover:text-hk-primary focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
        href="/contacto"
      >
        Ir a contacto
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
